  "distinction": "33 spine segment subjects plus 7 additional reflection prompts. Editorial index, not 40 unique vertebrae.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C1",
      "editorial_slot": "C1",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "Before a thought becomes a claim, name what was actually noticed.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C2",
      "editorial_slot": "C2",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "A change in viewpoint does not erase the first viewpoint.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C3",
      "editorial_slot": "C3",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "The map begins where the reader decides to look.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C4",
      "editorial_slot": "C4",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "A spoken sound can be held without deciding what it means.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C5",
      "editorial_slot": "C5",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "A direction is useful only after its origin is declared.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C6",
      "editorial_slot": "C6",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "The next step belongs to the sequence, not to a guessed destination.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-C7",
      "editorial_slot": "C7",
      "section": "cervical-segment study",
      "text": "Rest belongs inside the count when the rhythm includes rest.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T1",
      "editorial_slot": "T1",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "A signal can arrive without carrying its own interpretation.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T2",
      "editorial_slot": "T2",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Two neighboring records are not automatically the same event.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T3",
      "editorial_slot": "T3",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Mark the difference between observing and remembering.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T4",
      "editorial_slot": "T4",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "A translation is a second record, not a replacement for the first.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T5",
      "editorial_slot": "T5",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Count the boundaries before naming the size of the path.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T6",
      "editorial_slot": "T6",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Every comparison needs a declared pair of measures.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T7",
      "editorial_slot": "T7",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "A recurring pattern is a question before it is a conclusion.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T8",
      "editorial_slot": "T8",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Keep the instrument and the object it measures distinct.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T9",
      "editorial_slot": "T9",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Record the exception that refuses to fit the pattern.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T10",
      "editorial_slot": "T10",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "Write what was heard before explaining what was meant.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T11",
      "editorial_slot": "T11",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "A route can branch without duplicating its source.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-T12",
      "editorial_slot": "T12",
      "section": "thoracic-segment study",
      "text": "The last item must be counted under the same rule as the first.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-L1",
      "editorial_slot": "L1",
      "section": "lumbar-segment study",
      "text": "A weight is not a value until its unit is known.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-L2",
      "editorial_slot": "L2",
      "section": "lumbar-segment study",
      "text": "Combine records only after their identifiers are checked.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-L3",
      "editorial_slot": "L3",
      "section": "lumbar-segment study",
      "text": "An average without its denominator conceals the route.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-L4",
      "editorial_slot": "L4",
      "section": "lumbar-segment study",
      "text": "Evidence is stronger when missing observations are visible.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-L5",
      "editorial_slot": "L5",
      "section": "lumbar-segment study",
      "text": "A correction should leave a way back to the original.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-S1",
      "editorial_slot": "S1",
      "section": "sacral-segment editorial study",
      "text": "What is joined can still keep its own name.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-S2",
      "editorial_slot": "S2",
      "section": "sacral-segment editorial study",
      "text": "The history of an addition is part of the finished sum.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-S3",
      "editorial_slot": "S3",
      "section": "sacral-segment editorial study",
      "text": "The whole should not conceal how its parts were counted.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-S4",
      "editorial_slot": "S4",
      "section": "sacral-segment editorial study",
      "text": "Keep the original source separate from the later classification.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-S5",
      "editorial_slot": "S5",
      "section": "sacral-segment editorial study",
      "text": "An index should return the reader to the point where the trail began.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-Co1",
      "editorial_slot": "Co1",
      "section": "coccygeal-segment editorial study",
      "text": "The mirror reveals structure; it does not manufacture proof.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-Co2",
      "editorial_slot": "Co2",
      "section": "coccygeal-segment editorial study",
      "text": "A reversal can change order without changing which letters were used.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-Co3",
      "editorial_slot": "Co3",
      "section": "coccygeal-segment editorial study",
      "text": "When the sequence ends, record the endpoint.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-Co4",
      "editorial_slot": "Co4",
      "section": "coccygeal-segment editorial study",
      "text": "The boundary has a shape only when its convention is named.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR1",
      "editorial_slot": "NR1",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "Look again at the original before repairing the interpretation.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR2",
      "editorial_slot": "NR2",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "A sound and a spelling can agree in one way and differ in another.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR3",
      "editorial_slot": "NR3",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "Hold the cue apart from the story told about the cue.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR4",
      "editorial_slot": "NR4",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "The reader may reject a suggested connection without losing the source.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR5",
      "editorial_slot": "NR5",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "A source can be preserved even when a hypothesis is withdrawn.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR6",
      "editorial_slot": "NR6",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "Leave an empty field visible rather than filling it with certainty.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "XR-NR7",
      "editorial_slot": "NR7",
      "section": "additional cervical reflection",
      "text": "The record keeps the route open when recollection ends.",
      "source_status": "new_assistant_drafted_proposal_not_original_recovered_reflex_point",
      "use": "draft_opening_sentence_pending_author_review"
    }
  ]
}
